      "message": "not sure I understand the underlying reason for this.\nThis would be detrimental for a small task - the ones with no boost and no prefer_idle, it would look at the big cluster first, perhaps choose a cpu there and then look at the smaller group, and end up choosing a cpu in smaller group.",
